Subject: [PATCH 267/267] 3070 (b): the approve tap is answered by the server,
 no model run
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Misho's yes word for word (§140). On the plan card's approve tap, while day
one is still coming, the server approves the plan (the same gate as before),
starts day one, and writes „დამტკიცდა. ვიწყებ ახლავე." (en/ru/es as
approved) as the run's reply, before any prompt is built. A typed yes, a
plan already in force outside the day-one window, or any failure leaves it
to the model as before. APPROVE_LINE_ON switches it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
